u.src:
But they do not recognize Me in
truth;
Hence they fall.

p.src:
Those who are devoted to the gods go
to the gods;
Those who are devoted to the ancestors
go the the ancestors;
Those who are devoted to the spirits
go to the spirits;
Those who worship Me come surely
toMe.

